4,"Kissi, Northern in Sierra Leone - Joshua Project",https://joshuaproject.net/people_groups/12722/SL,"The Northern Kissi inhabit the thick tropical forests of Guinea, as well as small areas in Liberia and Sierra Leone. They speak a Niger-Congo language called Kisi (or Gizi).","Kissi, Northern",Niger-Congo
